lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
1. mai karbala ke biyabaan, say aayi hoon amma,<br>
jigar pe daagh bahattar, kay laayi hoon amma,<br>
sakina bibi ko dafna ke aayi hoon amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
2. hai abb bhi meri nigahon, mein asr ka manzar,<br>
chalaya shimr ne sookhe, gale pe jab khanjar,<br>
tumhara laal ragardta tha eydiyaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
3. jab aayi shaam e gareeban, naye sitam toote,<br>
ridayein cheen li sar se, jala diye qaimay,<br>
pinayi abid e muztar ko bediyaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
4. kabhi thi seliyaan durre, kabhi tamachay they,<br>
rawa sakina ke kaano, se khoon k dhaaray they,<br>
sitam ne cheen li bacchi ki baliyaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
5. guzar rahe they jo raaho, se hum jhukaaye<br>
nazar,<br>
ali ki betiyaan koofa, tha aur be-chader,<br>
harr aik simt se uthti thi ungliyaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
6. gire jo raahon me oonto, ki pusht se bacchay,<br>
nazer ke saamne maao, ki mar gaye bacchay,<br>
watan ko aaye hai khaali hai godiyaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma<br>
<br>
7. likha hai nauha jo khud nauhakhaan hai<br>
shaokat,<br>
azaa ke farsh se paayi, hai arsh tak izzat,<br>
rahengay hashr mein hum iss ke sayebaan amma.<br>
lahad pe fatima zahra kay tha bayaan amma